 "transcriber_notes": "Measured on the embedded 6160x2832 chart raster. Boundaries printed on the right axis (41 and 33 via bent leaders); drawn lines agree with printed values (22.92 px/cm). Hardness from bar ends against gridlines (class spacing 260 px), thirds of a class as +/-. Temperature axis is labelled in °F and has no tick marks; values converted to °C using the pixel calibration shared by all charts of this batch (0 C at x=2116.0 px, 46.84 px/C, fitted on the dashed air-temperature lines of seven °C charts, residuals <1 px); the °F label spacing (207.7 px per 8°F = 46.7 px/C) agrees. Readings fall on round °C values (-13.5, -13.0, -10.0, ...), which suggests the data were stored in °C; +-0.1 C. Temperatures from a red polyline without markers: break points at 107 (surface), 97, 90, 70, 60, 50, 20 and 0 cm; 80, 40, 30 and 10 cm sampled on straight segments. The dashed air segment starts at -7.5 C (18.5°F) versus the printed 19°F (-7.2 C); header air_temp_c is the printed value converted."
